# NextReach Studio — Environment Variables
#
# None required. The site is fully static and runs on Cloudflare Pages with no
# server-side runtime, so there are no secrets to configure.
#
# The Cerebras-backed /api/chat endpoint was removed on 2026-10-17. It had no
# client and was the only reason a serverless adapter was required.
# If a future route needs a secret, do not add it here — use `wrangler secret put`
# and read it through the Cloudflare binding, not a build-time env var.
